--  Roles with a category (Rose ADR 0021): a command with a categorised
--  role, one with a dotted category, and a composite of both and a public
--  role. Standard_Error is public, so it has no category line.

command Rose.Core.Probe : Probe_Roles, Standard_Error
  with Summary => "Show what a command's roles need."
is
end Rose.Core.Probe;
